      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1440,
      "width": 519.2,
      "height": 20.0,
      "text": "last = indice de onde vou ESCREVER            (comeca em 5)",
      "originalText": "last = indice de onde vou ESCREVER            (comeca em 5)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#7048e8",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1069385274,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1326480189,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790782254761,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "el_1107",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 405.90000000000003,
      "height": 22.5,
      "text": "A CADA VOLTA do while, o PC faz 4 coisas:",
      "originalText": "A CADA VOLTA do while, o PC faz 4 coisas:",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1098302523,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 462648708,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790782254761,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "el_1108",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1540,
      "width": 510.40000000000003,
      "height": 80.0,
      "text": "  1. Olha nums1[m] e nums2[n]  (os dois valores apontados)\n  2. Decide qual e maior  (um simples if)\n  3. Copia o maior para nums1[last]\n  4. Recua SO o ponteiro usado (m-- ou n--) e recua last--",
      "originalText": "  1. Olha nums1[m] e nums2[n]  (os dois valores apontados)\n  2. Decide qual e maior  (um simples if)\n  3. Copia o maior para nums1[last]\n  4. Recua SO o ponteiro usado (m-- ou n--) e recua last--",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#7048e8",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1190286278,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 819761618,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790782254761,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "el_1109",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1680,
      "width": 528.0,
      "height": 40.0,
      "text": "'Recuar' = fazer   m = m - 1.   E so aritmetica.\nO while repete ate m ou n chegarem a zero (dados esgotados).",
      "originalText": "'Recuar' = fazer   m = m - 1.   E so aritmetica.\nO while repete ate m ou n chegarem a zero (dados esgotados).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 731744488,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1714388288,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790782254761,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "el_1110",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1760,
      "width": 290.40000000000003,
      "height": 30.0,
      "text": "5) ANALOGIA PARA FIXAR",
      "originalText": "5) ANALOGIA PARA FIXAR",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 812406271,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1628860802,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790782254761,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "el_1111",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1805,
      "width": 484.00000000000006,
      "height": 140.0,
      "text": "Imagine 2 pilhas de cartas ordenadas (maior em cima).\nVoce tem uma caixa com espacos numerados e vai enchendo\ndo ULTIMO espaco para o primeiro.\n\nA cada rodada: pega a carta mais alta das duas pilhas,\npoe no ultimo espaco livre, e recua a mao SO na pilha\nde onde tirou a carta. Simples assim.",
      "originalText": "Imagine 2 pilhas de cartas ordenadas (maior em cima).\nVoce tem uma caixa com espacos numerados e vai enchendo\ndo ULTIMO espaco para o primeiro.\n\nA cada rodada: pega a carta mais alta das duas pilhas,\npoe no ultimo espaco livre, e recua a mao SO na pilha\nde onde tirou a carta. Simples assim.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 459981940,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 13066663,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790782254761,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "el_1112",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2060,
      "width": 580.8000000000001,
      "height": 30.0,
      "text": "6) O CODIGO (cada linha = um pedaco da aula)",
      "originalText": "6) O CODIGO (cada linha = um pedaco da aula)",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#adb5bd",
      "backgroundColor": "#f1f3f5",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1335977390,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 150298042,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790782254761,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "el_1113",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -10,
      "y": 2100,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 440
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 177813708,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 802107822,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790782254761,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "el_1114",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10,
      "y": 2115,
      "width": 519.2,
      "height": 300.0,
      "text": "last = m + n - 1              # comeco no FIM de nums1\n\nwhile m > 0 and n > 0:        # enquanto os dois tem cartas\n    if nums1[m-1] > nums2[n-1]:   # quem e maior?\n        nums1[last] = nums1[m-1]  # copio o de nums1\n        m -= 1                    # SO o m recua\n    else:\n        nums1[last] = nums2[n-1]  # copio o de nums2\n        n -= 1                    # SO o n recua\n    last -= 1                     # last SEMPRE recua\n\nwhile n > 0:                  # sobrou carta em nums2?\n    nums1[last] = nums2[n-1]  # copio o resto\n    n -= 1\n    last -= 1",
      "originalText": "last = m + n - 1              # comeco no FIM de nums1\n\nwhile m > 0 and n > 0:        # enquanto os dois tem cartas\n    if nums1[m-1] > nums2[n-1]:   # quem e maior?\n        nums1[last] = nums1[m-1]  # copio o de nums1\n        m -= 1                    # SO o m recua\n    else:\n        nums1[last] = nums2[n-1]  # copio o de nums2\n        n -= 1                    # SO o n recua\n    last -= 1                     # last SEMPRE recua\n\nwhile n > 0:                  # sobrou carta em nums2?\n    nums1[last] = nums2[n-1]  # copio o resto\n    n -= 1\n    last -= 1",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ],
